                                "example_id": "14f4e486-0210-4216-ad8f-f94ad666e3e3",
                                "sense_id": "c56b0493-04d2-3c10-8054-daa752c0e06b",
                                "text": "пе́редо мно́й",
                                "translation": "in front of me",
                                "english": "in front of me"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d4dabc4-9e96-4598-b364-a686d8fdcd93",
                                "sense_id": "c56b0493-04d2-3c10-8054-daa752c0e06b",
                                "text": "О́браз молодо́й де́вушки носи́лся передо мно́ю, се́рдце переста́ло пры́гать, но ка́к-то прия́тно сжима́лось.",
                                "translation": "The image of the young girl floated before me, my heart was no longer leaping, but was full of a sort of sweet oppression.",
                                "english": "The image of the young girl floated before me, my heart was no longer leaping, but was full of a sort of sweet oppression."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
